version: "0.6"
abstract: >-
  A 100,326-record classical-cryptography dataset spanning 85 cipher-type
  labels and 9 languages. Version 0.6 adds 300 deterministic synthetic RS44,
  German Double Playfair, and AMSCO records while preserving the original
  100,026-record prefix byte for byte. Synthetic records are CC0; 54 historical
  records retain per-record public-domain assertions and provenance.
keywords:
  - cryptanalysis
  - classical ciphers
  - benchmark dataset
  - cipher breaking
  - llm evaluation
  - cryptography education
